{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Benchmarks","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The benchmark suite measures the same workloads at several committed FirebladeECS revisions, such as a release tag against ","type":"text"},{"code":"main","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". The workloads cover entity creation, destruction and lookup, adding and removing components, iterating families, system updates and component events. Revisions with value-type components run each workload on both the ","type":"text"},{"code":"archetype","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and the ","type":"text"},{"code":"sparseSet","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" storage (see ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ChoosingAStorage","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"), so a report also shows what the storage choice costs.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"How results are made trustworthy","level":3,"anchor":"How-results-are-made-trustworthy","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Each revision is built once and measured in ","type":"text"},{"code":"k","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" independent process replicates, interleaved in a seeded random order. The replicate is the unit of analysis: the centre value is the median of the replicate medians, with a distribution-free order-statistic 95% confidence interval. A speed-up against the baseline is the Hodges–Lehmann estimate with its exact confidence interval, tested with an exact Mann–Whitney test and adjusted across all comparisons of a report with Benjamini–Hochberg. A change counts as ","type":"text"},{"code":"faster","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"slower","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" only when it is significant and clears the ±5% equivalence zone; an interval inside that zone is reported as ","type":"text"},{"code":"equivalent","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", anything else as ","type":"text"},{"code":"inconclusive","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Read and reproduce","level":3,"anchor":"Read-and-reproduce","type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The latest published report: "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/fireblade-engine.github.io\/ecs\/benchmarks\/"},{"type":"text","text":". Reports are published for dedicated benchmark releases only, the first one with 2.0.0; the page shows the newest."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The statistical design and workload parity notes: "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/fireblade-engine\/ecs\/blob\/main\/Documentation\/Benchmarks\/Methodology.md"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To measure revisions locally, pass comma-separated tags, branches or commit IDs. Results are saved under ","type":"text"},{"code":"Benchmarks\/Results\/<UTC timestamp>\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["make benchmark-compare REFS=1.4.3,main:2.0.0 REPLICATES=10 BENCHMARK_FILTER='.*'","make benchmark-report RESULTS=\"Benchmarks\/Results\/<run>\/*.json\" REPORT_BASELINE=1.4.3"],"syntax":"sh","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Without ","type":"text"},{"code":"BENCHMARK_FILTER","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" only 16 entities of every workload plus ","type":"text"},{"code":"entity.create.no-entities","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (which only has 0 entities) run. ","type":"text"},{"code":"make benchmark-report","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" renders the single file ","type":"text"},{"code":"BenchmarkReport.html","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" from saved results and never runs benchmarks. See ","type":"text"},{"code":"Benchmarks\/README.md","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for all options.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"See how FirebladeECS revisions compare on a shared workload suite, and run the comparison yourself.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/benchmarks"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"article","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"metadata":{"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","title":"Benchmarks","modules":[{"name":"FirebladeECS"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Essentials","generated":true,"title":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/GettingStartedWithFirebladeECS","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ReadingAndWritingComponents","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentMacro","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ReactingToNexusEvents","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ChoosingAStorage","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/SavingAndLoadingScenes","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/MigratingToFirebladeECS2","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEvent","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEventDelegate","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEventMask","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus\/StorageKind"]}],"references":{"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/Nexus/StorageKind":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus\/StorageKind","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"StorageKind"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The storage a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus"},{"type":"text","text":" keeps its entities and components in."}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"StorageKind"}],"url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/nexus\/storagekind","title":"Nexus.StorageKind"},"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS","title":"FirebladeECS","url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A lightweight, fast and easy to use Entity-Component System in Swift."}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/Nexus":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus","abstract":[],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Nexus"}],"url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/nexus","title":"Nexus","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Nexus"}]},"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/ReadingAndWritingComponents":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ReadingAndWritingComponents","title":"Reading and writing components","url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/readingandwritingcomponents","role":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Read a copy, replace a component or change it in place."}],"kind":"article"},"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/MigratingToFirebladeECS2":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/MigratingToFirebladeECS2","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Move a project from FirebladeECS 1.x to 2.0: components become value types, and every write goes through the nexus."}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/migratingtofirebladeecs2","title":"Migrating to FirebladeECS 2","role":"article","kind":"article"},"https://github.com/fireblade-engine/ecs/blob/main/Document